config OTP_MCHP_FUSES
	bool "Microchip PIC32CK calibration/OTP fuse row driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MICROCHIP_PIC32CK_FUSES_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable read access to the calibration/OTP fuse row (FUSES_CALOTP) of
	  Microchip PIC32CK SG/GC SoCs.

	  The row is provisioned during manufacturing, so the "program"
	  operation is not supported.
